{{#*inline "title"}}Enterprise Memberships | Twennie{{/inline}}

<div class="membership-container membership-container--enterprise">
  <h2 class="membership-title" style="color:#4a4ab2">Twennie for enterprise</h2>

  <p class="membership-description membership-enterprise-intro">
    Twennie can be deployed three ways depending on how much customization and integration you want.
    All enterprise options include volume pricing and a guided rollout plan. Contact Twennie and we’ll help you pick the right level.
  </p>

  <div class="membership-grid membership-grid--enterprise">

    <!-- TOP TIER -->
    <div class="membership-grid-item">
      <div class="membership-grid-inner membership-standard-layout">

        <div class="membership-icon-area">
          <div class="membership-image-container">
            <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/leaderbluey_2.png"
                 alt="Top Tier"
                 class="membership-character-image">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-title-area">
          <h3 class="membership-plan-name">TOP TIER</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-subtitle-area">
          <p class="membership-subtitle">full integration</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-benefits-area">
          <ul class="membership-benefits-list">
            <li>Twennie becomes a dedicated platform on your servers</li>
            <li>Your team logs into a custom environment built for your organization</li>
            <li>Twennie founder + member units can feed into your custom library</li>
            <li>Add your own training units, governance, and internal topics</li>
            <li>Ideal for high adoption, unique workflows, or strict IT requirements</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-description-area">
          <p class="membership-description">
            Best for firms that want Twennie to feel like an internal system: branded, tailored, and integrated into how your teams actually work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-price-area">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Top%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="discount-link">contact Twennie</a>
          <p class="membership-price">custom quote</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-buttons">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Top%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="membership-button">contact</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MID TIER -->
    <div class="membership-grid-item">
      <div class="membership-grid-inner membership-standard-layout">

        <div class="membership-icon-area">
          <div class="membership-image-container">
            <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/blueygroup2.png"
                 alt="Mid Tier"
                 class="membership-character-image">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-title-area">
          <h3 class="membership-plan-name">MID TIER</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-subtitle-area">
          <p class="membership-subtitle">custom portal + reporting</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-benefits-area">
          <ul class="membership-benefits-list">
            <li>Dedicated topic portal tailored to your organization</li>
            <li>Customized reporting and dashboards for leaders</li>
            <li>Optional additions: custom topic trees, internal categories, roll-up metrics</li>
            <li>Volume pricing for your team size</li>
            <li>Faster deployment than full integration</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-description-area">
          <p class="membership-description">
            Best for firms that want a tailored experience and strong reporting, without hosting a full custom platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-price-area">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Mid%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="discount-link">contact Twennie</a>
          <p class="membership-price">custom quote</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-buttons">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Mid%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="membership-button">contact</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LOW TIER -->
    <div class="membership-grid-item">
      <div class="membership-grid-inner membership-standard-layout">

        <div class="membership-icon-area">
          <div class="membership-image-container">
            <img src="https://www.twennie.com/images/bluey1.png"
                 alt="Low Tier"
                 class="membership-character-image"
                 style="height: 160px">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-title-area">
          <h3 class="membership-plan-name">LOW TIER</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-subtitle-area">
          <p class="membership-subtitle">volume pricing</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-benefits-area">
          <ul class="membership-benefits-list">
            <li>Negotiated volume pricing for your team size</li>
            <li>Access the full Twennie library</li>
            <li>Standard group + leader functionality</li>
            <li>Fast rollout with minimal setup</li>
            <li>Great for pilots and first-year deployments</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-description-area">
          <p class="membership-description">
            Best for firms that want enterprise-scale access quickly, without custom features.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-price-area">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Low%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="discount-link">contact Twennie</a>
          <p class="membership-price">custom quote</p>
        </div>

        <div class="membership-buttons">
          <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Low%20Tier%20Inquiry"
             class="membership-button">contact</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div> <!-- closes membership-grid -->

  <div class="membership-button-container">
    <a href="mailto:info@twennie.com?subject=Enterprise%20Membership%20Inquiry"
       class="membership-button">contact Twennie about enterprise</a>
  </div>
</div>
